Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:18:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Language maps: the language tag without quotes

A language map with a reference (rml:languageMap [ rml:reference
"$.language" ]) gave the value quoted as a literal, "apple"@"en", which is
not valid N-Triples (RMLTC0031b, kg-construct/rml-core). The JSON paths now
write the language tag without its quotes (language_tag).
Test: tests/test_language_map.py.
---
