 rdfizer/rdfizer/functions.py       |  7 +++++
 rdfizer/tests/test_language_map.py | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 rdfizer/tests/test_language_map.py

